    {
      "id": "5E9FA02AABB379C7",
      "title": "&f&lPractice a clean escape&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fParCool adds movement options with their own controls and conditions. Practice on a safe course, check your available movement resources and learn a route back to solid ground.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fTest ladders, ledges and recovery in town before attempting the same movement over a dangerous drop.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
