    {
      "id": "589A1BB4EA0D3A88",
      "title": "&f&lCurios, Artifacts and Relics&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fArtifacts, Relics and their selected integrations add equipment with their own activation and upgrade rules. Read their tooltips and inspect Curios slots. Carry a few useful effects instead of assuming every found item works from the main inventory.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fTest the effect in a safe area and check any charge, cooldown or unlock condition.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
