        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fKeep spare food, tools, blocks and a return plan at home. Shared quest progress does not remove the need to recover from an expedition that goes wrong.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fMake the kit accessible to teammates who may help you return.",
